500pt solid windowtext;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.7500pt solid windowtext;border-top:none;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.7500pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.7500pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >计算存储成本</font></span><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.7500pt 3.7500pt 3.7500pt 3.7500pt ;border-left:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.7500pt solid windowtext;border-top:none;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.7500pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.7500pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >较多，每一个业务过程需要计算存储一次</font></span><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.7500pt 3.7500pt 3.7500pt 3.7500pt ;border-left:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.7500pt solid windowtext;border-top:none;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.7500pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.7500pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >较少，不同业务过程融合到一起，降低存储计算量，</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >但是非当前业务过程的度量存在大量零值</font></span><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td></tr></table><h3 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >2.2.5 父子事实的处理方式</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >交易父子订单的含义在前文确定粒度时有所说明，在同一家店铺同时下单的多件商品，不仅每件商品有一个子订单，这几个子订单会再单独产生一个父订单。下单和支付都是在父订单粒度上完成的，比如拍下时的订单总额、支付的总额、支付的邮费，交易事务事实表在粒度选取上，按照粒度最细原则，确定为子订单，因此需要将下单总额或者支付总额分摊到每个子订单上，当然只有一个子订单时是不需要进行分摊的。这里以子订单分摊的有效下单金额和子订单分摊的支付金额加以说明。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo21;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >子订单下单金额</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >=3D下单商品数量*商品价格</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo21;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >子订单分摊有效下单金额</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >=3D下单商品数量*商品价格+父订单邮费*下单分摊比例-子订单折扣-父订单折扣*下单分摊比例</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo21;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >下单分摊比例</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >=3D(下单商品数量*原价-子订单折扣)/sum(下单商品数量*原价-子订单折扣)</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo21;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >子订单分摊的支付金额</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >=3D父订单支付金额*支付分摊比例</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo21;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >支付分摊比例</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >=3D(下单商品数量*原价-子订单折扣+调价)/sum(下单商品数量*原价-子订单折扣+调价)</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >通过分摊父订单的金额将所有业务过程的度量全部带进交易事务事实表中</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >，包括了下单数量、商品价格、子订单折扣、下单分摊比例、父订单支付金额、父订单支付邮费、父订单折扣、子订单下单金额、子订单下单有效金额、支付分摊比例、子订单支付金额等等，将父子事实同时冗余到事务表中。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h3 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >2.2.6 事实的设计原则</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l11 level1 lfo22;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >事实完整性</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >事实表包含与其描述的过程有关的所有事实，即尽可能多的获取所有的度量。在交易事务事实表中，比如支付业务过程，子订单粒度上的支付金额、支付邮费、支付红包、支付积分、支付折扣，都有所包含，覆盖全面。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l24 level1 lfo23;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >事实一致性</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >在确定事务事实表的事实时，明确的存储每一个事实以确保度量的一致性。以交易事务事实表为例，下单业务过程中，有下单商品数量和商品价格两个事实，但在事实表中计算了下单金额和下单有效金额，这些可以通过商品数量乘以商品价格进行计算，虽然下游在取数时也可以通过这种方式完成计算，但是在事实表中统一计算可以保证这个度量的一致性，其他如支付过程中的分摊金额等也是类似的。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l10 level1 lfo24;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >事实可加性</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >事实表确定事实时，往往会遇到非可加性的度量，比如分摊比例、利润率等，这些虽然也是下游分析的关键点，但</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >往往在事务事实表中更多是关注可加性的事实</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >，下游用户在聚合统计时更加方便。在交易事务事实表中，存储了分摊比例这样的度量，但更多的是存储各类金额的度量。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h1 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >3.代码示例</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h1><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >3.1 业务场景</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >假设我们有一个电商交易业务产品，需要分析用户的订单交易行为。作为数据开发人员，</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >需要设计一张事务事实表将记录每一笔订单的详细信息（如订单时间、客户、产品、金额等）。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >3.2 示例数据表</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3D21  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >源系统表结构</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >(MYSQL)</font></